    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9922" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντι-δράω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δράσω [ᾱ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>act against, retaliate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παθὼν μὲν ἀντέδρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					271
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				953
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				438
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				4.2.2
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὰς πράξεις ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					959
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				3.29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc.
			pers., <i>repay, requite,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινὰ κακῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1191
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cri.</u>
				49d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενναῖα γὰρ παθόντες ὑμᾶς ἀντιδρᾶν
					ὀφείλομεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					1179
				</span></i>
			.</div>
